der":"not_legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{5}{G}{U}","name":"Simic Sky Swallower","oracle_id":"e5c48c6d-a7bf-45b3-b48c-dc884d49c5f7","oracle_text":"Flying, trample\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)","power":"6","produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2020-11-20","toughness":"6","type_line":"Creature — Leviathan"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won't return to the battlefield.","oracle_id":"6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Once the exiled permanent returns, it's considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.","oracle_id":"6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The returned card won't be the target of any spells or abilities that targeted it before. Any spells that don't target, such as Akroma's Vengeance, will still affect it.","oracle_id":"6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"When an effect returns the exiled card \"under your control,\" you control it indefinitely after that. In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any creatures you control from Cloudshift's effect are exiled.","oracle_id":"6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.","oracle_id":"85271333-af96-447a-8a16-9fadf0eaedb2","published_at":"2008-10-01","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
